# Logging

Use `log/slog` only. Build process loggers with `github.com/lordnynex/mcp/lib/logger`. Never import `"log"`. MCP servers must log to stderr so stdout stays free for stdio transport.

```go
// ❌ BAD
import "log"

log.Fatal(err)

// ✅ GOOD
import (
    "log/slog"

    "github.com/lordnynex/mcp/lib/logger"
)

logger.SetDefault(logger.Options{Level: slog.LevelInfo})
slog.Error("command failed", "err", err)
```
